{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34313","headline":"袭美见题郊居十首因次韵酬之以伸荣谢 七 · 陆龟蒙","name":"袭美见题郊居十首因次韵酬之以伸荣谢 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"禹穴奇编缺，雷平异境残。\n静吟封籙检，归兴削帆竿。\n白石堪爲饭，青萝好作冠。\n几时当斗柄，同上步罡坛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34313.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34313","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}